        "lingua_originale": "en",
        "titolo_orig": "Ayman Mhanna: 'Lebanon has become the theatre for a war between Israel and Iran'",
        "testo_it": "L'analista Ayman Mhanna definisce il Libano teatro di una guerra per procura tra Israele e Iran.",
        "priorita": "Alta",
        "id_gruppo": 1,
        "link": "https://www.france24.com/en/ayman-mhanna-lebanon-has-become-the-theatre-for-a-war-between-israel-and-iran",
        "orario": "08:04",
        "timestamp": 1773903840,
        "contenuto_esteso": "To display this content from YouTube, you must enable advertisement tracking and audience measurement. One of your browser extensions seems to be blocking the video player from loading. To watch this content, you may need to disable it on this site. Ayman Mhanna: 'Lebanon has become the theatre for a war between Israel and Iran' Middle East Issued on: 19/03/2026 - 08:04 Modified: 19/03/2026 - 08:26 Nadia Massih is pleased to welcome Ayman Mhanna, Executive Director of the Beirut-based Samir Kassir Foundation. The war between Iran and Israel is unfolding in Lebanese territory. While Lebanon demonstrates notable competence in distributing humanitarian aid, coordinating with international institutions, and mitigating social fragmentation, Mr. Mhanna explains, it remains structurally incapable of exercising political sovereignty over armed non-state actors, particularly Hezbollah. This undermines both internal legitimacy and international credibility. Qatar orders departure of two Iranian diplomats over gas facility attack 18/03/2026 Middle East 'Acute risk' that Iraq could become once again victim of internal conflict as Iran war progresses 18/03/2026 Middle East Iran did not try to rebuild enrichment after June 2025 attack, US intel chief says 18/03/2026 Middle East Both sides in Iran war ratchet up attacks on energy facilities, as oil prices surge 18/03/2026 Middle East Elisa Catalano Ewers: Israeli leadership moves to destabilise regime’s leadership structure 18/03/2026 Middle East Soler i Lecha: Foreign policy of Pedro Sánchez 'widely supported by the Spanish population' 18/03/2026 Spain Crowds gather for funeral of top security official Ali Larijani 18/03/2026 Middle East Beirut building collapses amid fresh Israeli strikes in capital city's centre 18/03/2026 Middle East Iran using cluster munitions in retaliatory strikes on Israel 17/03/2026 Middle East"
